            <ArticleTitle>[Application of a new pain balm based on TCM].</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s00482-017-0253-7</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the context of an unsuccessful treatment over several years of existing knee pain after various sports injuries, a young, healthy female patient was treated with a novel pain balm based on traditional Chinese medicine. This resulted in a significant improvement in the stimulation and pain conditions without any recognizable local and systemic side effects.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
